OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA grey start towards the east
OL,6,Fwith perhaps the odd spot of rain.
OL,7,FBrighter skies in the west though will
OL,8,Fspread across all parts leading to a
OL,9,Fsunny afternoon. Cooler than of late,
OL,10,Fbut still feeling warm in the sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining dry and fine this
OL,13,Fevening with plenty of evening
OL,14,Fsunshine. Skies will turn cloudy
OL,15,Fovernight with the odd spot of rain in
OL,16,Fthe west by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
