OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA rather cloudy start but some
OL,6,Fbreaks will develop allowing some
OL,7,Fsunshine. Feeling warm and humid with
OL,8,Fa few spots of rain possible, which
OL,9,Fmay turn heavier later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain
OL,12,Fis likely to move across the region on
OL,13,FTuesday, perhaps with some heavier
OL,14,Fbursts. Sunshine and showers on
OL,15,FWednesday and Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
